    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matter of Factory brings a whole new Local PvP experience! Battle with your friends in the fight to build and complete more orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Work like your life depends on it, cuz it does...&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for resources, build toys, sabotage your opponent, and survive random events to come out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=794 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends, or by yourself on multiple different maps, each with unique mechanics, to unlock skins, hats, and other customization items to show off your skill! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Bragging rights included)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>BUILD TO WIN</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to get the resources you need off of the conveyor belt, and build your order. Watch out for your opponent trying to sabotage you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>SABOTAGE YOUR OPPONENT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sabotage tokens from the conveyor belt and spin the Sabaslot machine to get a competitive edge! Four different sabotages can be used strategically to stop (or just annoy) your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<u>UPCOMING FEATURES IN DEVELOPMENT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiple Maps To Play!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matter of Factory will come with multiple different maps to explore and play together, each featuring their own special mechanic and atmosphere! Unlock new maps by playing, and unlocking achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock Skins, Hats, and Trails to Customize Your Worker!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete certain achievements to receive a ticket! Use tickets to get a mystery box, unlocking a random item your player can wear!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matter of Factory brings a whole new Local PvP experience! Battle with your friends in the fight to build and complete more orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Work like your life depends on it, cuz it does...&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for resources, build toys, sabotage your opponent, and survive random events to come out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=794 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/d826de8ebbc280d1a0a0847f9e80e730.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends, or by yourself on multiple different maps, each with unique mechanics, to unlock skins, hats, and other customization items to show off your skill! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Bragging rights included)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>BUILD TO WIN</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to get the resources you need off of the conveyor belt, and build your order. Watch out for your opponent trying to sabotage you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/4850a9ce170a31113ee33fe6449edf0d.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>SABOTAGE YOUR OPPONENT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sabotage tokens from the conveyor belt and spin the Sabaslot machine to get a competitive edge! Four different sabotages can be used strategically to stop (or just annoy) your friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.poster.avif?t=1755491534\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.webm?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738160/extras/a65c21f774cee75a82c8ad9ce8a8d9ad.mp4?t=1755491534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<u>UPCOMING FEATURES IN DEVELOPMENT</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiple Maps To Play!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matter of Factory will come with multiple different maps to explore and play together, each featuring their own special mechanic and atmosphere! Unlock new maps by playing, and unlocking achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock Skins, Hats, and Trails to Customize Your Worker!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete certain achievements to receive a ticket! Use tickets to get a mystery box, unlocking a random item your player can wear!</p>",
